---
import BookingStatus from '../../BookingStatus.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroBasketballImg from '../../../assets/hero_basketball.jpg';
import heroRunningImg from '../../../assets/hero_running.jpg';
---

<section class="approach-hero" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="section-shell approach-hero__grid">
      <div class="approach-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE FORGE APPROACH</p>
        <h1 id="approach-title">Recover.<br /><span>Build.</span> Perform.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Rehabilitation shouldn't just get you out of pain. It should prepare you for what comes next.</p>
        <p>At Forge, physical therapy is about understanding the problem, rebuilding physical capacity, and confidently returning to the things that matter to you.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>
      <figure class="approach-hero__media">
        <Image src={heroBasketballImg} alt="A basketball player moves on an indoor court" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption>Licensed demo stock. Does not depict Forge people, facilities, treatment, or outcomes.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-progression" aria-labelledby="progression-title">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <header class="approach-progression__heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">THE PROGRESSION</p>
          <h2 id="progression-title">Three stages.<br />One direction: <span style="color: var(--gold-bright)">forward.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each phase builds on the one before it—first understanding and calming the problem, then rebuilding capacity, then preparing you for the demands of the life or activity you want to return to.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="approach-cards">
        <article id="recover" class="approach-card approach-card--recover">
          <div class="approach-card__heading">
            <span class="approach-card__number">01</span>
            <div>
              <p class="approach-card__kicker">First, we figure out what's going on.</p>
              <h3>Recover</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="approach-card__lead">Pain is a signal—not always the whole problem.</p>
          <p>Your first step at Forge is a comprehensive evaluation designed to understand why you're having difficulty, not simply where it hurts.</p>
          <ul aria-label="Recover focus areas">
            <li>History</li>
            <li>Movement &amp; mobility</li>
            <li>Strength &amp; control</li>
            <li>Activity demands</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="approach-card__goal">
            <span>The goal</span>
            <strong>Reduce symptoms. Restore movement. Build a foundation for what's next.</strong>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="build" class="approach-card approach-card--build">
          <div class="approach-card__heading">
            <span class="approach-card__number">02</span>
            <div>
              <p class="approach-card__kicker">Feeling better isn't the finish line.</p>
              <h3>Build</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="approach-card__lead">Once your symptoms are improving, rehabilitation shouldn't simply stop.</p>
          <p>Through progressive exercise and strength training, we'll develop the physical qualities you need to handle the demands of your life.</p>
          <ul aria-label="Build focus areas">
            <li>Strength</li>
            <li>Mobility</li>
            <li>Stability &amp; control</li>
            <li>Capacity</li>
            <li>Confidence</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="approach-card__goal">
            <span>The goal</span>
            <strong>Don't just get back to where you were. Build toward where you want to be.</strong>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="perform" class="approach-card approach-card--perform">
          <div class="approach-card__heading">
            <span class="approach-card__number">03</span>
            <div>
              <p class="approach-card__kicker">Ready is more than pain-free.</p>
              <h3>Perform</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="approach-card__lead">The final stage bridges the gap between feeling better and being ready.</p>
          <p>Your rehabilitation progresses toward the specific demands of your life—whether that's sport, training, work, family, or simply moving confidently again.</p>
          <ul aria-label="Perform focus areas">
            <li>Running &amp; lifting</li>
            <li>Sport &amp; recreation</li>
            <li>Work &amp; family</li>
            <li>Confident movement</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="approach-card__goal">
            <span>The goal</span>
            <strong>Return to what you love with the strength and confidence to do it.</strong>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-life surface-light" aria-labelledby="life-title">
    <div class="section-shell approach-life__grid">
      <figure>
        <Image src={heroRunningImg} alt="Two runners stand at starting blocks on an outdoor track" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Licensed demo stock.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="approach-life__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">INDIVIDUALIZED CARE</p>
        <h2 id="life-title">Your rehabilitation should look like your life.</h2>
        <p>There isn't one perfect exercise, protocol, or timeline for everyone. Two people can have the same diagnosis and completely different goals.</p>
        <div class="approach-life__examples">
          <article><span>Athlete</span><p>Sprint, cut, jump, and change direction.</p></article>
          <article><span>Lifter</span><p>Squat, deadlift, press, and progressively load.</p></article>
          <article><span>Parent</span><p>Pick up their child and move through daily life with confidence.</p></article>
        </div>
        <p class="approach-life__statement">The diagnosis may be similar. <strong>The rehabilitation shouldn't be.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-one-on-one" aria-labelledby="one-on-one-title">
    <div class="section-shell approach-one-on-one__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">ONE-ON-ONE CARE</p><h2 id="one-on-one-title">Your session. Your goals. Your time.</h2><p>Every visit has a purpose, and your plan evolves as you do.</p></div>
      <ol aria-label="Typical session focus"><li>Assessment</li><li>Treatment</li><li>Exercise</li><li>Progression</li><li>Education</li></ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-close" aria-labelledby="close-title">
    <div class="section-shell approach-close__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">THE FORGE PHILOSOPHY</p><h2 id="close-title">Don't just return. Build forward.</h2><p>Getting out of pain is important. Getting back to your life is better. Building the strength and capacity to stay there is the goal.</p></div>
      <BookingStatus />
    </div>
  </section>
